OL,3,GNEWSAStaff at Coca-Cola bottle supplier
OL,4,Avote to strike
OL,5,
OL,6,FAround 40 workers at a West Yorkshire
OL,7,Fhaulage firm which supplies Coca-Cola
OL,8,Fand a number of major beer
OL,9,Fmanufacturers have voted to go on
OL,10,Fstrike.
OL,12,FUnite the Union said staff at Lockwood
OL,13,FHaulage Ltd, based in Knottingley and
OL,14,FSouth Kirkby would walk out
OL,15,Findefinitely from next Wednesday, 2
OL,16,FSeptember.
OL,18,FUnite said forklift truck drivers and
OL,19,Fmachine operators in Lockwood's glass
OL,20,Fdivision voted to walk out in a dispute
OL,21,Fover pay and plans to introduce an
OL,22,Fattendance-based bonus scheme.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
